嫁其弟。齊桓公怒，伐蔡；蔡潰，遂虜繆侯，南至楚邵陵。已而諸侯爲蔡謝齊，齊侯歸蔡侯。二十九年，繆侯卒，子莊侯果立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本篇明示親屬稱呼，不由繼位推父子，不補闕代、無名者名字或原文未見的同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji035-041","subject_person_id":"cbr-p001398","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001397","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p012","quote":"莊侯三年，齊桓公卒。十四年，晉文公敗楚於城濮。二十年，楚太子商臣弒其父成王代立。二十五年，秦穆公卒。三十三年，楚莊王即位。三十四年，莊侯卒，子文侯申立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本篇明示親屬稱呼，不由繼位推父子，不補闕代、無名者名字或原文未見的同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji035-014","person_id":"cbr-p001397","title":"莊侯","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p011","quote":"繆侯以其女弟爲齊桓公夫人。十八年，齊桓公與蔡女戲船中，夫人蕩舟，桓公止之，不止，公怒，歸蔡女，而不絶也。蔡侯怒，嫁其弟。齊桓公怒，伐蔡；蔡潰，遂虜繆侯，南至楚邵陵。已而諸侯爲蔡謝齊，齊侯歸蔡侯。二十九年，繆侯卒，子莊侯果立。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji035-014:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p011","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"莊侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0107","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"侯、公及諡號等暫作敘事追稱，不把繼位當當時授予諡號；未知曆日與終點不按卒日補造。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji035-056","person_id":"cbr-p001397","surfaces":["莊侯","莊侯果"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-035-guancai"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p011","quote":"繆侯以其女弟爲齊桓公夫人。十八年，齊桓公與蔡女戲船中，夫人蕩舟，桓公止之，不止，公怒，歸蔡女，而不絶也。蔡侯怒，嫁其弟。齊桓公怒，伐蔡；蔡潰，遂虜繆侯，南至楚邵陵。已而諸侯爲蔡謝齊，齊侯歸蔡侯。二十九年，繆侯卒，子莊侯果立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p012","quote":"莊侯三年，齊桓公卒。十四年，晉文公敗楚於城濮。二十年，楚太子商臣弒其父成王代立。二十五年，秦穆公卒。三十三年，楚莊王即位。三十四年，莊侯卒，子文侯申立。"}],"rationale":"依文王子同母十人、蔡曹君世系、蔡女船中事件、楚公子圍弒其王及城濮／伐曹的具體敘事暫定異稱。郟敖／夾敖按同一事件、釐／僖負羈按本卷論贊暫同指；不同國與同國不同世代的同名者分開。匿名者、校勘及跨篇同指仍待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p011","text":"繆侯以其女弟爲齊桓公夫人。十八年，齊桓公與蔡女戲船中，夫人蕩舟，桓公止之，不止，公怒，歸蔡女，而不絶也。蔡侯怒，嫁其弟。齊桓公怒，伐蔡；蔡潰，遂虜繆侯，南至楚邵陵。已而諸侯爲蔡謝齊，齊侯歸蔡侯。二十九年，繆侯卒，子莊侯果立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"繆侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001116","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"蔡女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001116","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001116","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"蔡女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001116","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"蔡侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m011-0060","start":60,"end":63,"